Title: Schacht's Resignation
subtitle: The Reichsbank President Departs
new-page: true
view-if: year = 1930 and (month >= 3 and month <= 4)
tags: event, economics
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: schacht_resigned = 1 if not secret_mode
face-image: img/portraits/SchachtHjalmar.jpg
go-to: hilferding_outcome if chud = 1; root if secret_mode

= Schacht's Resignation

Hjalmar Schacht has submitted his resignation as President of the Reichsbank. [? if schacht_exposed = 1 : This follows our exposure of his secret connections to the Nazi Party. ?]

Who should succeed him?

- @support_luther: Hans Luther is chosen as compromise candidate.
- @support_blessing: Support Karl Blessing.
- @propose_hilferding: Propose Rudolf Hilferding for the leadership.
- @accept_voegler: Albert Vögler takes the mantle.

@support_luther
choose-if: spd_in_government = 1 or spd_toleration = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 0 : We lack the influence to affect this appointment. ?]
on-arrival: reichsbank_president = "Luther"; schacht_relation -= 5; z_relation += 5; dvp_relation += 5; ddp_relation += 3; bvp_relation += 3; reichsbank_independent = 2; reformist_strength += 2;

Hans Luther has been selected as the Reichsbank President. It seems he won't change the course much from orthodoxy and will likely seek the way to co-operate with Brüning.

@support_blessing
view-if: (wtb_support >= 5 or wtb_adopted) and spd_in_government
on-arrival: reichsbank_president = "Blessing"; schacht_relation -= 3; z_relation += 2 if z_relation >= 45; z_relation -= 3 if z_relation < 45; dvp_relation -= 2; ddp_relation += 2; left_strength += 3; reformist_strength += 5; neorevisionist_strength += 4; financial_crisis_progress -= 2 if financial_crisis_progress > 0; reichsbank_independent = 0; credit_expansion_possible = 1;

Karl Blessing has been selected as the Reichsbank President. He proposes mild measures to combat the deflation, however his influence is weak enough to change the direction of Reichsbank.

@propose_hilferding
view-if: spd_in_government and (left_strength + center_strength >= 45)
choose-if: ( spd_in_government = 1 and (finance_minister = "Hilferding")) or (chud = 1)
unavailable-subtitle: [? if left_strength < 40 and neorevisionist_strength < 35 : The party lacks conviction for such a radical move. Need stronger left or neorevisionist faction. ?] [? if spd_in_government != 1 : We must be in government to propose this. ?] [? if finance_minister != "Hilferding" and wtb_adopted != 1 : Need Hilferding as Finance Minister or WTB plan adopted to make this credible. ?]
on-arrival: reichsbank_proposal = "hilferding"
go-to: hilferding_outcome

@hilferding_outcome
on-arrival: {!
    var support_threshold = 0;
    if (Q.spd_r >= 28 && Q.left_strength >= 45 && Q.kpd_relation >= 35) {
        Q.support_threshold = 1;
    }

    if (Q.chud === 1) Q.support_threshold = 1;
    
    if (support_threshold === 0) {
        Q.hilferding_rejected = 1;
        Q.reichsbank_president = "Luther";
        Q.z_relation -= 8;
        Q.dvp_relation -= 12;
        Q.ddp_relation -= 6;
        Q.dnvp_relation -= 10;
        Q.bvp_relation -= 8;
        Q.left_dissent -= 10;
        Q.reformist_dissent += 8;
        Q.neorevisionist_dissent += 5;
        Q.reichsbank_independent = 2;
    } else {
        Q.hilferding_accepted = 1;
        Q.reichsbank_president = "Hilferding";
        Q.z_relation -= 15;
        Q.dvp_relation -= 20;
        Q.ddp_relation -= 10;
        Q.dnvp_relation -= 25;
        Q.bvp_relation -= 15;
        Q.kpd_relation += 10;
        Q.left_strength += 8;
        Q.socialism += 10;
        Q.reichsbank_independent = -2;
        if (Q.chud === 1) Q.budget += 3;
    }
!}
go-to: hilferding_rejected_text if hilferding_rejected; hilferding_accepted_text if hilferding_accepted

@hilferding_rejected_text

In our attempt to push Hilferding forward, Reichsbank thought this was some sort of joke by SPD and has refused them their way, with Hans Luther put in charge.

@hilferding_accepted_text
achievement: socialist_reichsbank

Against all the odds, we have forced and coerced our way through to elect Hilferding. Bourgeouisie are considering breaking up with us over this insensitive maneuver.

[? if chud : And certainly, world is known for nothing happenistas. If something happened, refer to the graph. Hilferding Chudhimir said so. ?]

@accept_voegler
view-if: (spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 0) or (reichsbank_independent >= 4 and schacht_relation < 40)
on-arrival: reichsbank_president = "Vögler"; dvp_relation -= 3; z_relation -= 3; left_strength += 5; workers_spd -= 2; capital_strike_progress -= 2 if capital_strike_progress > 0; reichsbank_independent = 1; business_power += 1

[? if spd_in_government = 0 and spd_toleration = 0 : Unable to influence the choice, we watch as ?] [+ president +] appoints industrialist Albert Vögler. Perhaps, we were alienated them enough to consider this option.
